tablephotography studio light setup features a built-in rechargeable battery and a large Edge-Lit bi-color LED panel for professional-quality illumination.<\/p><p>Adjustable Color Temperature<\/p><p>The LED studio panel light has a color temperature range from 2700K to 7500K, allowing you to <a href=\"https:\/\/lumipia.com\/blogs\/news\/how-to-set-up-professional-lighting-for-a-makeup-video\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"photography-lighting-kit\"><strong>adjust the color temperature<\/strong><\/a>. You can adjust the color temperature according to different photography spaces.<\/p><p>Long Battery LifeThe LED panel light is equipped with a built-in rechargeable lithium-ion battery, which can provide you with reliable performance during long shooting.<\/p><p>Compact and Portable DesignThe LED studio light is compact and portable, which is convenient for you to use outside. <\/p><p>The LEDpanel light is a perfect companion for outdoor shooting or travel photography.<\/p><p>Versatile Lighting ControlThe LEDpanel lighting stand kitcan seamlessly adjust the transition between warm and cool tones, allowing you to easily get the lighting effect you want.<\/p><p>User-friendly OperationThe LED studio lights have an intuitive control knob and switch, which is easy to operate and suitable for beginners and experienced professionals.<\/p><p>LEDstudio light is perfect for photographers, bloggers, and content creators. Take your lighting to the next level with this versatile LED studio lighting!<\/p>","text_size":"text-base"}}},"block_order":["heading_EbVgqN","text_P6rcHF"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"","content_alignment":"left","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":50,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed"}},"feature_list_cW3d9c":{"type":"feature-list","blocks":{"feature_item_VbCwL3":{"type":"feature_item","settings":{"color_scheme":"","icon":"check","icon_style":"btn--secondary","text":"Free shipping"}},"feature_item_NzxQGa":{"type":"feature_item","settings":{"color_sch